<title>USA: NHL ICE HOCKEY-MONDAY'S STANLEY CUP CONFERENCE FINALS RESULT.</title>
<headline>NHL ICE HOCKEY-MONDAY'S STANLEY CUP CONFERENCE FINALS RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of National Hockey</p>
<p>League Stanley Cup playoff game on Monday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>	 Western Conference finals</p>
<p> DETROIT	     3  Colorado	    1</p>
